        <h1>FinPhasor — Phase-Preserving Measurement of Cross-Sectional Timing in Equity Markets</h1>
        <div class="sub">Signal processing says a signal is magnitude <em>and</em> phase. Financial deep learning predicts a scalar return — magnitude with no phase — and so cannot see when a stock reprices relative to the market. FinPhasor models that timing as a stock characteristic, with a complex wavelet representation, an oscillator template and a scale-conditioned Transformer.</div>
