        </figure>
        <figure>
          <img src="/projects/finphasor/media/architecture.png" alt="Model architecture with the two explanation read-outs: the forward path from the three input streams through scale-conditioned cross-attention and eight band decoder paths to the predicted complex scalogram, a Grad-CAM backward tap giving indicator and frequency attribution, and a forward-only attention tap giving the attention map and sentence-level highlights." loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="margin:0 auto" />
